{"nodes": [{"id": "cnc_readme", "label": "Kinetiq CNC backend README", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_readme_kinetiq_cnc_backend", "label": "Kinetiq CNC backend (src/server/cnc)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L1-L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CNCjs GRBL server code carried into Kinetiq so Kinetiq no longer depends on ../CNCJS-fork; folder layout mirrors CNCjs so relative imports are unchanged; Kinetiq changes are marked with // Kinetiq: or // SECURITY (Kinetiq): comments."}, {"id": "cnc_readme_cncjs", "label": "CNCjs 1.11.5 (CNCJS-fork commit a3922a1bf)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_license", "label": "CNCjs MIT LICENSE", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_readme_kinetiq_change_markers", "label": "// Kinetiq: and // SECURITY (Kinetiq): change markers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_services_cncengine_cncengine", "label": "CNCEngine.js", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only the Grbl controller is registered (Marlin/Smoothie/TinyG removed). Since 2026-11-09 the list handler falls back to rc-file ports when serial detection fails so the fake controller and manually listed ports stay selectable."}, {"id": "cnc_readme_port_list_fallback", "label": "Port list fallback 