: "GrblController.setExclusive(on)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "While exclusive, query timer sends no ?/$G and Feeder lines are dropped (Feeder reset); real-time bytes via write() (Hold, Reset) still go out; turning off clears query masks. Used by settings editor XModem upload."}, {"id": "cnc_readme_xmodem_upload", "label": "Settings editor XModem upload", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_readme_feeder", "label": "Feeder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_readme_query_timer", "label": "Query timer (?/$G status polling)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_lib_eventtrigger", "label": "lib/EventTrigger.js", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L12,L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_services_taskrunner_index", "label": "services/taskrunner/index.js", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L12,L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_services_taskrunner_index_run", "label": "taskRunner.run()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "cnc/README.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cnc_readme_not_carried_over", "label": "Not carried over: Express app, REST API, i18n, views, Marlin/Smoothie/TinyG, CNCjs CLI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "cnc/README.m